GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4521650,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4521650","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:02:37Z","value":117,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4691110","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4521650-1846651706689478","game_id":"steam-4521650","kind":"announcement","title":"🌾 Farm & Feast is in Steam Next Fest! Play the Demo! 🍳","summary":"Hello everyone!We are incredibly excited to announce that Farm & Feast is officially part of the Steam Next Fest! As a two-person indie team, we have been pouring our hearts into creating a truly cozy farming and restaurant management experience, and we can't wait for you to try it.In this demo, you will get a taste of running your very own culinary business. You can:Grow your ingredients: Plant seeds, harvest crops, and turn wheat into fresh flour at the Windmill.Cook delicious meals: Use your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:46:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689478","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521650-1846018067941516","game_id":"steam-4521650","kind":"announcement","title":"Farm & Feast is part of the Steam Cooking Fest! 🍳🌾","summary":"Hi everyone! We are super excited to announce that Farm & Feast is participating in the Steam Cooking Fest! Whether you are discovering our cozy farm and restaurant world for the first time through the festival, or you have already played an earlier version, now is a great time to jump into the demo! Thanks to your amazing feedback and suggestions, we have been hard at work adding lots of new features and improvements to the game, including: ☕ Coffee Machine: Brew coffee to calm down customers w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T16:22:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941516","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521650-1846018067930549","game_id":"steam-4521650","kind":"update","title":"Farm & FeastDemo Patch Notes v0.1.6","summary":"🎣 NEW: FISHING Fishing is here! Unlock the Fishing Rod at 800 Hype, buy it from the Workshop, head to the new dock and catch fresh fish for your kitchen.New hold-to-reel system: hold to charge and cast, watch the bobber until a fish bites, then hold to reel it in. Ease off when the fish fights back, or the line snaps. 🌾 NEW: WHEAT → FLOUR → BREAD Full production chain: plant wheat in the field by the windmill, harvest it into a bale, drop the bale at the Windmill and pick up fresh flour sacks.Ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:54:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521650-1845383656390087","game_id":"steam-4521650","kind":"update","title":"Farm & Feast Demo Patch Notes v0.1.5","summary":"☕ Coffee Stand Are guests losing patience while the kitchen is busy? Bring them a hot coffee and their Patience Bar freezes for a while. Coffee costs a few coins to brew and earns no profit, so pour it only when you need to. When the pot runs out, the chefs brew a fresh one on their own. It unlocks on Day 5 with a short tutorial. 🍰 Dessert Stand Served a dish late or made a mistake? Give your guests a dessert while they're eating, before they ask for the bill, to raise their rating. Desserts ear","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T22:23:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390087","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521650-1844751498228283","game_id":"steam-4521650","kind":"update","title":"🌱 Farm & Feast Demo Patch Notes v0.1.41","summary":"DECORATION MODE IMPROVEMENTSStyle preview: Hover or select a style/color to see it on the object before you buy.Sell decorations: Press C (keyboard) or X (gamepad) to sell items for 90% of their price. Works from the scene or from your storage in the catalog. Style purchases are not refunded. Free items and starting tables can't be sold.Buy/sell feedback: A floating \"-$X\" / \"+$X\" appears with a purchase sound.Reworked gamepad controls: The catalog stays open while you walk around. D-pad browses ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T00:02:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228283","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521650-1843481262696165","game_id":"steam-4521650","kind":"announcement","title":"🌿 The Farm & Feast Demo is Officially LIVE! Welcome to Your Cozy Restaurant!","summary":"Hey everyone! zbeedev and arttec here! After months of hard work, we are beyond thrilled to announce that the Farm & Feast demo is now officially live on Steam! As a two-person core indie team, we wanted to create a low-stakes, relaxing world where you can escape the daily stress. In this demo, you will get a taste of what it is like to grow your own fresh ingredients, manage a bustling little restaurant, and serve happy customers. What’s in the Demo? Stress-Free Management: No harsh penalties, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T18:42:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521650-1842846814449925","game_id":"steam-4521650","kind":"update","title":"🌾 Farm & Feast Playtest Patch Notes v0.1.2","summary":"Hey farmers! Thank you for all the reports and feedback. This update brings a big content drop plus a round of fixes. 🏡 Decorate your restaurant• New Decoration Mode: place plants, lamps and wall pieces• New style variants for floors, walls, wood, kitchen, tables and chairs• Decorations unlock as your hype grows, with a notification when a new one opens up• The restaurant is wider now, with more room to decorate 🔧 Workshop• New upgrades: bigger drink tray, carry several plates at once, faster mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T23:26:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4521650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4521650":"2026-10-26T02:52:15Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4521650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4691110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4521650","app_id":4521650,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:39Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseServi